      "message": "thanks for reminder, I will move `CancelStreamingRequest` to `bta_ag_sco_conn_close`, because `bta_ag_sco_conn_close` is only used with `BTA_AG_SCO_CLOSE_EVT `, and in `bta_ag_sco_conn_close` is the place call `bta_sys_sco_close`",
